<title>UK: EIB sets 500 million Swiss franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 500 million Swiss franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.00	MATURITY    05.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.70    PAY DATE    05.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    =	   EOS	   24.JAN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
